<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ M-3 money supply rose 2.4 pct in October.</title>
<headline>NZ M-3 money supply rose 2.4 pct in October.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand on Thursday released the following estimated money supply figures for October:</p>
<p>    M3		   Oct 1996	Sept 1996	  Oct 1995</p>
<p>    mthly change	2.4 pct	  0.1 pct	   1.3 pct</p>
<p>    yr-on-yr change  15.1 pct	 13.8 pct	  10.8 pct</p>
<p>    PSC		  Oct 1996	Sept 1996	  Oct 1995</p>
<p>    mthly change	0.8 pct	 -0.6 pct	   1.5 pct</p>
<p>    yr-on-yr change  14.0 pct	 14.9 pct	  11.3 pct</p>
<p>    M1		   Oct 1996	Sept 1996	  Oct 1995</p>
<p>    mthly change	1.8 pct	  3.9 pct	   1.7 pct</p>
<p>    yr-on-yr change   1.1 pct	  1.1 pct	  -3.0 pct</p>
<p>-- Welington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
